The files diff-wordmode.js, token-map.js, sentence-diff.js, block-replace.js
and the computeDiff function in index.js were vendored from:

  https://github.com/yuch85/office-word-diff
  commit 81315f2fae23ba8cf9f40c13bdfd17d0e444d137

licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this
directory). They were vendored so this project can co-evolve the
diff-application layer (e.g. the CJK char-level strategy in char-diff.js)
with the rest of the codebase, independent of upstream availability and
licensing changes.

Modifications relative to upstream: files renamed to kebab-case, import
paths adjusted to the local directory, and the unused exports
(OfficeWordDiff class, applyWordDiff, getDiffStats, logger utilities) were
not vendored. char-diff.js is original code of this project.
